# Say It with a Handbag (crystalWar 41), the quest's own var at the completion (missions as the main flow's): accepted,
# sayItWithAHandbagCS 4, the Repaired Handbag and Quest[7][41]Prog 1 (GMs). Hampu-Kampu: 174; finished:
# npcUtil.completeQuest (the Trainee's Needle, the CS var 0, completed), then the handbag taken and
# sayItWithAHandbagBonusCS 1. npcUtil.completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[7][41]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup
# would clear it).
lists WindurstWatersS/Hampu-Kampu/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/174
char zone=WindurstWatersS pos=-114.097,-1,-158.703 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
quest CrystalWar.SayItWithAHandbag accepted
charvar sayItWithAHandbagCS 4
keyitem RepairedHandbag
charvar Quest[7][41]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Hampu-Kampu                     # the handbag, CS 4: 174
finish                                  # the Trainee's Needle; the CS var 0; completed, Prog kept; the handbag taken
trigger Hampu-Kampu                     # completed: 175
finish
